      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOHO AMARYLLIS (3) broke fresh but was good at Maryborough last start where she drew wide and worked but fought well to miss narrowly. Draws better and won her only previous third-up attempt so can peak. BROADWAY OBSESSION (1) resumes off some solid form including a Kilmore win and a second from this barrier at this venue. Trialling well and should get her chance from this draw. SWEET FLORABEL (7) has placed in her two starts here so far, coming from this barrier and crossing the line first before losing on protest last time. Still learning but the penny could drop here. YOUVE BEEN SERVED (4) has won a trial since she was disqualified last start and had finished top-two in her other three starts including an easy Mildura win so respect.",
